{
  "appid": 1097150,
  "name": "糖豆人",
  "type": "game",
  "short_description": "《糖豆人》是一款免费跨平台大规模多人游玩的派对乱斗游戏。你要和其他竞争者一起，在愈加夸张混乱的障碍赛回合中一较高下，最后只会有一名幸运赢家！",
  "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097150/extras/94a1e81cca7374756496150c242beeeb.poster.avif?t=1698763175\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097150/extras/94a1e81cca7374756496150c242beeeb.webm?t=1698763175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097150/extras/94a1e81cca7374756496150c242beeeb.mp4?t=1698763175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>来《糖豆人》蠢萌的赛场上，一路不停俯冲躲闪，拿下胜利吧。不管你是萌新还是大佬，是单枪匹马还是呼朋引伴，《糖豆人》在不断完善自身的同时，都会给你带来爆笑连连的体验。在这里比胜利更重要的，只有在赢得胜利时看上去越傻越好。抓上你最搞怪的套装，排好队伍——专题游戏秀即将开始！<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097150/extras/bef50fa14369a91bdc5c4ef75168149c.poster.avif?t=1698763175\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097150/extras/bef50fa14369a91bdc5c4ef75168149c.webm?t=1698763175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097150/extras/bef50fa14369a91bdc5c4ef75168149c.mp4?t=1698763175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>竞技与合作：在充满竞技性的免费乐翻天回合中加入混战，在合作挑战中齐心协力——或与最多 3 名好友组队，接受雷霆巨豆中心的挑战！<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097150/extras/6b20d7871018994007f6a4ff50b97fa8.poster.avif?t=1698763175\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097150/extras/6b20d7871018994007f6a4ff50b97fa8.webm?t=1698763175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097150/extras/6b20d7871018994007f6a4ff50b97fa8.mp4?t=1698763175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>和朋友一同游玩：《糖豆人》免费开放游玩，登录 Epic Games 账号后还支持跨平台游戏、跨平台组队和跨平台进度同步。<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097150/extras/c9607f6ac734ebe3db87dc5f14b37e5a.poster.avif?t=1698763175\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097150/extras/c9607f6ac734ebe3db87dc5f14b37e5a.webm?t=1698763175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097150/extras/c9607f6ac734ebe3db87dc5f14b37e5a.mp4?t=1698763175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>不断完善的内容：《糖豆人》会不断推出限时活动与全新游戏模式，让你常玩常新。除此之外，每个赛季我们还将推出新的套装、联动、障碍物以及玩法。<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097150/extras/6284f76f9e482ed326104f971bdc03f2.poster.avif?t=1698763175\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097150/extras/6284f76f9e482ed326104f971bdc03f2.webm?t=1698763175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1097150/extras/6284f76f9e482ed326104f971bdc03f2.mp4?t=1698763175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>多样的定制可能：这里有大量的颜色、花纹、套装以及姓名牌供你选择。以当下热门的庆祝动作迎接胜利，用不同的表情展现自己的过人之处吧！<br><br>所展示的物品可能需要从游戏内商店单独购买，并依实际上架情况而定。本游戏包含游戏内购买项目。",
